1
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:14,700
Did he play the sympathy card with you?

2
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:16,500
No, he didn't.

3
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:20,180
We were hoping you'd persuade him to cooperate,

4
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:21,820
so we wouldn't have to pull an all-nighter.

5
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:23,620
You're underestimating him.

6
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:24,940
Back in college,

7
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:26,900
he was amazing at debating.

8
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:28,560
Even I was no match for him.

9
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:31,440
Then you'd better step it up, Team Leader Geng.

10
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:37,220
They were set up on a blind date,

11
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:38,220
and Team Leader Geng stood him up.

12
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:39,880
That's how the grudge started.

13
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:47,140
Hello?

14
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:49,500
Okay, got it.

15
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:51,380
Team Leader,

16
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:53,140
there's a new development with Zhao Yong.

17
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:54,380
What is it?

18
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:56,380
He said that during his last interrogation,

19
00:00:56,420 --> 00:00:57,740
there were things he left unsaid.

20
00:00:58,620 --> 00:00:59,280
Captain Lin,

21
00:00:59,760 --> 00:01:01,600
should we question him again tomorrow?

22
00:01:02,940 --> 00:01:04,020
With a guy like him,

23
00:01:04,460 --> 00:01:07,640
the worst part is when he tells half-truths.

24
00:01:08,060 --> 00:01:09,300
Then we'll find a way

25
00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:11,980
to pry the truth out of him.

26
00:01:12,940 --> 00:01:13,740
Team Leader Lin,

27
00:01:17,340 --> 00:01:18,200
good luck.

28
00:01:24,780 --> 00:01:26,540
Sir, I'll cooperate.

29
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:28,120
I'll fully cooperate.

30
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:30,240
Even at this point,

31
00:01:30,420 --> 00:01:31,460
you're still holding back.

32
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:33,500
You're only hurting yourself, you know that?

33
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:34,480
I know.

34
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:35,780
I understand.

35
00:01:37,100 --> 00:01:38,460
I'm just a security guard.

36
00:01:39,220 --> 00:01:41,060
How could I decide who wins the bid?

37
00:01:41,360 --> 00:01:42,700
At most, I just do things like

38
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:43,540
clearing the area,

39
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,380
stopping or letting people through.

40
00:01:45,880 --> 00:01:46,640
All I did was...

41
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:47,880
whoever paid me,

42
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:51,220
I let them linger by the experts' entrance.

43
00:01:52,220 --> 00:01:53,020
That's all.

44
00:01:53,540 --> 00:01:55,940
At most, I took photos of the experts for them

45
00:01:56,540 --> 00:01:57,420
and sent them over.

46
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:58,540
2,000 each.

47
00:01:59,300 --> 00:02:00,620
Mine was just small-time stuff.

48
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:02,360
Small-time stuff?

49
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:04,260
How is it not small-time?

50
00:02:04,900 --> 00:02:06,860
The ones with real power are the experts.

51
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:08,800
All that bidding,

52
00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:10,340
bid opening, bid evaluation...

53
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:12,280
That's all just for show.

54
00:02:13,020 --> 00:02:13,940
When it comes down to it,

55
00:02:14,300 --> 00:02:15,660
isn't it up to those experts?

56
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,660
It all depends on their scores.

57
00:02:17,220 --> 00:02:18,700
Once their scores are out,

58
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,840
whoever is ranked first wins the bid.

59
00:02:22,260 --> 00:02:23,060
Sir,

60
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:24,640
let me tell you,

61
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:25,900
this project is way too big.

62
00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:27,640
There's too much money involved.

63
00:02:28,320 --> 00:02:30,480
Nobody would dare leave it to chance.

64
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:31,720
Then what do they rely on?

65
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:36,380
It's all about who knows the expert list.

66
00:02:38,300 --> 00:02:39,180
Go on.

67
00:02:40,020 --> 00:02:41,380
Between the moment the experts are drawn

68
00:02:41,540 --> 00:02:43,260
and when they enter the bidding room,

69
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:44,680
well,

70
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:46,640
there isn't much time in between.

71
00:02:47,220 --> 00:02:49,020
If anyone gets hold of that list,

72
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:52,200
they can pull strings and make calls,

73
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:54,140
or corner them at home with gifts.

74
00:02:54,380 --> 00:02:55,260
If it's any later,

75
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:56,500
the experts' phones will be confiscated,

76
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:58,320
and it'll be too late for anything.

77
00:02:59,340 --> 00:03:01,220
So who could find out the expert list beforehand?

78
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,000
Well, this...

79
00:03:02,100 --> 00:03:03,800
Sir, how would I know that?

80
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:05,120
I'm just a security guard.

81
00:03:06,220 --> 00:03:06,960
Though,

82
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,240
if you ask me,

83
00:03:08,420 --> 00:03:10,820
those ordinary companies

84
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,940
are just trying their luck at the door.

85
00:03:13,180 --> 00:03:14,420
The powerful companies,

86
00:03:14,620 --> 00:03:16,280
they don't bother waiting outside at all.

87
00:03:17,180 --> 00:03:18,820
Whoever controls the experts

88
00:03:20,020 --> 00:03:21,620
controls the outcome.

89
00:03:22,580 --> 00:03:24,180
Here's how the expert process works.

90
00:03:24,340 --> 00:03:25,740
Step one is opening the bids.

91
00:03:26,300 --> 00:03:27,880
Step two, selecting the experts.

92
00:03:28,140 --> 00:03:29,860
Step three, notifying the experts.

93
00:03:29,980 --> 00:03:32,660
The experts must arrive on-site within two hours.

94
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:35,160
Step five, closed-door evaluation.

95
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:38,000
Zhao Yong was right about one thing.

96
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:39,480
No matter how strict the procedure is,

97
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:41,140
the experts still assign the final scores.

98
00:03:41,900 --> 00:03:43,620
That's the real loophole.

99
00:03:44,820 --> 00:03:46,900
Bids for the Jianzhou Xiba Project open the day after tomorrow,

100
00:03:46,900 --> 00:03:48,020
starting at nine in the morning.

101
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:49,760
Once the opening ceremony ends,

102
00:03:49,760 --> 00:03:50,600
they'll go to the selection room

103
00:03:50,660 --> 00:03:51,900
to randomly draw the experts.

104
00:03:52,700 --> 00:03:55,140
No one knows the list of experts beforehand.

105
00:03:55,700 --> 00:03:57,420
Even after the draw, it's kept strictly confidential.

106
00:03:57,860 --> 00:04:00,220
Then, the experts will be called to the site,

107
00:04:00,320 --> 00:04:02,040
but they're only told the time and place,

108
00:04:02,040 --> 00:04:03,580
not the specific project.

109
00:04:04,420 --> 00:04:06,220
For the experts to reach the trading center,

110
00:04:06,220 --> 00:04:08,740
there's only a one to two-hour window.

111
00:04:09,340 --> 00:04:11,300
Not until they sign in do they learn

112
00:04:11,300 --> 00:04:12,700
which bid they're evaluating today.

113
00:04:13,300 --> 00:04:15,340
Inside the evaluation room, they only see

114
00:04:15,580 --> 00:04:17,900
blind bids with company names removed.

115
00:04:18,300 --> 00:04:19,620
Each expert scores individually,

116
00:04:19,740 --> 00:04:22,100
and the system calculates the totals and rankings.

117
00:04:22,700 --> 00:04:24,220
Whoever gets the highest score

118
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:27,000
wins the tender project.

119
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:28,920
So in other words,

120
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:31,940
if someone can get this list right away

121
00:04:32,140 --> 00:04:34,060
after the experts are drawn,

122
00:04:34,060 --> 00:04:37,060
the so-called random selection is completely compromised.

123
00:04:37,220 --> 00:04:38,620
Then our primary focus should be on the experts.

124
00:04:38,860 --> 00:04:39,700
Keep an eye on the experts,

125
00:04:40,220 --> 00:04:41,460
and monitor the selection process as well.

126
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,280
Whoever approaches the experts,

127
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:44,260
whoever contacts them,

128
00:04:44,520 --> 00:04:45,700
or gets suspiciously close,

129
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:47,180
record everything.

130
00:04:47,280 --> 00:04:47,800
Yes, sir.

131
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:51,820
Of the five companies bidding this time,

132
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:55,320
three are actually controlled by Du Qingbo.

133
00:04:55,880 --> 00:04:57,260
If what Zhao Yong said is true,

134
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:59,580
then the Jianzhou Xiba Project

135
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:01,920
is their most likely window to make a move.

136
00:05:02,660 --> 00:05:04,580
We must get solid evidence of them targeting the experts.

137
00:05:05,500 --> 00:05:06,300
Understood!

138
00:05:07,380 --> 00:05:08,180
Comrades,

139
00:05:09,420 --> 00:05:11,880
safeguarding an upright society

140
00:05:12,540 --> 00:05:15,160
and optimizing our city's business environment

141
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:16,480
are the duty

142
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:18,640
of the Public Resource Trading Center,

143
00:05:18,760 --> 00:05:19,540
as well as our mission.

144
00:05:20,180 --> 00:05:23,180
We must all keep this firmly in mind.

145
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:26,000
For the Jianzhou Xiba River Embankment

146
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:28,000
Greenery Renovation Project,

147
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:30,360
the total investment is 860 million.

148
00:05:31,020 --> 00:05:32,120
All of our departments

149
00:05:32,780 --> 00:05:34,380
must strictly monitor every step.

150
00:05:35,220 --> 00:05:36,580
Should we discover

151
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:39,660
any insider misconduct,

152
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:41,200
no matter who it is,

153
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,320
we will investigate to the very end

154
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:43,200
and show zero tolerance.

155
00:05:51,020 --> 00:05:51,560
Director,

156
00:05:51,820 --> 00:05:52,540
please sign this.

157
00:05:55,340 --> 00:05:56,680
For the Jianzhou Xiba project,

158
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,700
the date is set.

159
00:05:58,320 --> 00:05:59,840
Nine in the morning, day after tomorrow.

160
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:07,120
Boss Du was quite generous this time.

161
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:09,000
He offered to raise the cut himself.

162
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:09,760
This time,

163
00:06:10,340 --> 00:06:11,080
it's this amount.

164
00:06:13,320 --> 00:06:14,640
You're behind the times.

165
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,740
I heard that for our stage,

166
00:06:17,060 --> 00:06:18,620
in places outside the province,

167
00:06:19,020 --> 00:06:21,540
they take a percentage cut of the total value.

168
00:06:23,740 --> 00:06:25,580
Boss Du doesn't know how things work.

169
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,640
Go talk to him later.

170
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:30,360
Will do.

171
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:34,160
Mr. Du,

172
00:06:34,500 --> 00:06:37,840
Jianzhou Xiba bids open at 9:00 a.m., day after tomorrow.

173
00:06:38,180 --> 00:06:39,820
A storm is coming.

174
00:06:40,380 --> 00:06:42,120
How are Zhang Lei and his team doing?

175
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:44,980
Don't worry, everything is set.

176
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:48,140
Three of the five shortlisted companies are ours.

177
00:06:48,380 --> 00:06:49,740
As for the other two,

178
00:06:50,540 --> 00:06:51,940
they're Boss Jia's.

179
00:06:54,860 --> 00:06:56,140
Old Jia...

180
00:06:57,180 --> 00:06:58,080
What a great guy.

181
00:06:59,180 --> 00:07:00,340
He loses every bid,

182
00:07:00,780 --> 00:07:02,100
yet he shows up every time.

183
00:07:02,460 --> 00:07:04,340
Think of all the money he's saved us on cover bids.

184
00:07:04,860 --> 00:07:06,300
I almost feel bad for him.

185
00:07:23,260 --> 00:07:24,180
This car...

186
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:28,220
You can't park here.

187
00:07:28,460 --> 00:07:28,980
Drive further in.

188
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:30,540
The parking lot is right around back.

189
00:07:32,900 --> 00:07:33,560
Team Leader.

190
00:07:33,660 --> 00:07:35,060
The encrypted line is connected.

191
00:07:42,520 --> 00:07:44,220
I hope Zhao Yong doesn't screw this up.

192
00:07:45,060 --> 00:07:47,000
Do you know why we secretly summon you every time?

193
00:07:47,220 --> 00:07:48,280
We need your cooperation.

194
00:07:48,580 --> 00:07:49,560
Understood?

195
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:59,120
Jiang Peiyao has shown up.

196
00:08:17,200 --> 00:08:18,320
Du Qingbo is here too.

197
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,200
It's started.

198
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:44,240
Mr. Du.

199
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,280
You're here too.

200
00:08:45,340 --> 00:08:46,960
Of course I had to come.

201
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:48,480
I'm here to serve both the bidders

202
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:49,780
and the tendering agency.

203
00:08:49,780 --> 00:08:50,660
How could I not show up?

204
00:08:51,420 --> 00:08:53,020
Your service is almost too good.

205
00:08:53,660 --> 00:08:55,620
For projects handled by Jinxin Company,

206
00:08:55,620 --> 00:08:57,060
we've never won a single bid.

207
00:08:58,340 --> 00:09:00,460
Losing before doesn't mean you'll lose today.

208
00:09:01,020 --> 00:09:02,980
As they say, fortunes change.

209
00:09:04,660 --> 00:09:06,100
Well, go on and get back to work.

210
00:09:06,460 --> 00:09:07,540
Best of luck winning the bid today!

211
00:09:16,700 --> 00:09:18,820
Harmony brings wealth.

212
00:09:19,820 --> 00:09:21,420
Director, it's starting.

213
00:09:27,860 --> 00:09:29,160
Good morning, everyone.

214
00:09:29,700 --> 00:09:33,180
I'm Jiang Peiyao, General Manager of Jinxin Company.

215
00:09:33,680 --> 00:09:35,080
Commissioned by the tenderer,

216
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:37,120
our company is lawfully organizing

217
00:09:37,460 --> 00:09:40,920
the bid opening for the Jianzhou Xiba Greenery Project.

218
00:09:42,700 --> 00:09:43,880
Following the preliminary review,

219
00:09:44,060 --> 00:09:46,620
a total of five bidding units

220
00:09:46,780 --> 00:09:48,740
are participating in this bid.

221
00:09:50,280 --> 00:09:53,380
The project involves an investment of about 860 million yuan

222
00:09:53,580 --> 00:09:56,100
and is a key municipal infrastructure project.

223
00:09:56,620 --> 00:09:59,020
This tender strictly complies with

224
00:09:59,020 --> 00:10:01,580
the Bidding Law of the People's Republic of China

225
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:03,880
and relevant regulations.

226
00:10:04,220 --> 00:10:09,260
Experts were randomly selected from the expert pool.

227
00:10:09,980 --> 00:10:12,520
The evaluation process is sealed throughout,

228
00:10:12,640 --> 00:10:14,980
with supervisors present at all times

229
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:17,880
to ensure that every single step is

230
00:10:18,020 --> 00:10:19,300
open and transparent,

231
00:10:19,460 --> 00:10:20,920
fair and competitive,

232
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:22,760
and evaluated with impartiality.

233
00:10:23,800 --> 00:10:24,440
Lastly,

234
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:28,500
I wish every bidder the very best of success.

235
00:10:32,380 --> 00:10:36,340
I now officially announce the bid opening rules.

236
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:45,360
The bid opening and bid reading round is complete.

237
00:10:45,860 --> 00:10:48,420
Quotation materials will be retained on-site,

238
00:10:48,780 --> 00:10:52,020
and we will now enter the expert evaluation phase.

239
00:10:53,500 --> 00:10:54,680
Client representatives, please.

240
00:11:07,640 --> 00:11:08,300
This way, please.

241
00:11:09,300 --> 00:11:09,800
Have a seat.

242
00:11:09,800 --> 00:11:10,620
Please sit.

243
00:11:13,020 --> 00:11:16,220
The owner's representative will now draw the experts.

244
00:11:28,300 --> 00:11:29,540
Expert selection is complete.

245
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:34,840
No anomalies found on the server.

246
00:11:41,860 --> 00:11:42,500
Team Leader.

247
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:44,420
The expert selection has finished.

248
00:11:48,060 --> 00:11:48,980
Anything to report?

249
00:11:49,500 --> 00:11:50,380
Nothing unusual so far.

250
00:11:50,760 --> 00:11:51,600
Keep monitoring.

251
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:26,360
There's an unauthorized remote intrusion.

252
00:12:26,460 --> 00:12:27,440
Data is being transferred out.

253
00:12:34,280 --> 00:12:36,200
The attack is over.

254
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:38,080
Can you trace it back?

255
00:12:38,780 --> 00:12:39,660
Trace it immediately.
